# Derived from the EADOS factory template (.eados-core/templates/gitignore.tmpl) with three
# project-specific deviations, each marked [EGL] below:
#   1. `target/` is unanchored — a Maven reactor (ADR-001) has a target/ per module, so the
#      template's root-anchored `/target/` would miss core/target, jdbc/target, and so on.
#   2. JetBrains module files and compiled classes added (this repo is developed in IntelliJ).
#   3. Gradle/Cargo/node entries retained from the template even though this build is Maven —
#      they are harmless and keeping the template's shape makes future re-sync trivial.
#
# NOTE ON COMMENT PLACEMENT: a `#` only opens a comment at the START of a line. Trailing text after
# a pattern becomes part of the pattern, so `target/  # per-module output` silently matches nothing.
# All three deviations above were originally written that way and none of them worked; the first
# local `mvn verify` (item 1.4) surfaced nine untracked target/ directories. Annotations therefore
# go on their own line ABOVE the pattern they describe.

# Build outputs
/build/
/dist/
/out/
# [EGL] unanchored: per-module output in the Maven reactor
target/
# [EGL] Java bytecode
*.class
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
*.lib

# Dependency / package manager caches
/node_modules/
/.venv/
/venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/.gradle/
/vendor/
/.cargo/

# Coverage & test artifacts
/coverage/
*.gcda
*.gcno
*.profraw
.coverage
htmlcov/

# IDE / editor
/.idea/
# [EGL] JetBrains module files
*.iml
/.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Tool caches
/.mypy_cache/
/.ruff_cache/
/.pytest_cache/

# Generated docs
/docs/_site/
/docs/doxygen/html/

# Local agent / harness scratch (never commit)
.questions
.bugs
.claude/settings.local.json

# EADOS factory tooling — the .eados-core/ bundle is copied in to (re)generate this repo; it is
# not part of the project's own source.
/.eados-core/
